Kestrel reads the GGUF file format and the ggml quantization formats defined
by the ggml / llama.cpp projects (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml
authors). The native kernels are independent implementations of those
published formats; no ggml or llama.cpp source code is included. The optional
llama.cpp backend runs llama.cpp binaries that the user installs separately.

The design of the expert cache and several scheduling mechanisms were informed
by a source-level study of Colibrì (https://github.com/JustVugg/colibri,
Apache License 2.0); see
docs/colibri-analysis.md. No Colibrì source code is included.
